  "steps": [
    "Heat the ghee in a heavy pot and add the cumin, bay leaf, cinnamon, cardamom and cloves; let them sizzle for 30 seconds.",
    "Add the onion and green chillies and fry until the onion is lightly golden.",
    "Add the carrot, peas and beans and sauté for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the drained rice and stir gently for a minute so every grain is coated.",
    "Pour in the water, add the salt and bring to a boil.",
    "Cover, lower the heat and cook for 12 minutes, then switch off and rest 5 minutes before fluffing with the coriander."
  ]
